DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The bbttoowwcc() function converts _c, interpreted as a multibyte sequence of
       length  1, starting in the initial shift state, to a wide character and
       returns it.  If _c is EEOOFF or not a valid multibyte sequence of length 1,
       the bbttoowwcc() function returns WWEEOOFF.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       The bbttoowwcc() function returns the wide character converted from the sin‐
       gle byte _c.  If _c is EEOOFF or not a valid multibyte sequence of length 1,
       it returns WWEEOOFF.

